# {{name}}

How to work on this project. Source code is in `src/{{package}}` and tests are in `tests`.

## Install

```bash
uv sync
```

## Test

```bash
uv run pytest
```

## Lint and format

```bash
uv run ruff check .
```

```bash
uv run ruff format .
```

CI runs `uv run ruff check .`, `uv run ruff format --check .` and `uv run pytest` on Windows and Linux. Run them before you commit.

## Commits and branches

- Write commit messages as Conventional Commits, for example `feat: add a config loader` or `fix: handle an empty file`.
- Work on short branches and merge them into `main`.
